# Also left out of the Myron profile (ROOTFS_PACKAGE_PROFILE=myron), on top of
# packages.omarchy-skip. Strata is the file manager and the file chooser there
# (omamobile-apps-myron), so Nautilus, its Python extension host and the GNOME
# portal backend, which depends on Nautilus, stay out. check_myron_package_closure
# fails the build if anything resolves them again.
nautilus
nautilus-python
